 0<s<D. Define C_a(A,δ) as the infimum of Nat-indexed δ-cover sums ∑'ᵢ ediam(Uᵢ)^a. Empty sets cost zero for a>0. Unfolding M008, its supremum over nonempty witnesses gives exactly the same term for nonempty cover members and zero for empty ones; thus M008 identifies Hausdorff measure with sup_{δ>0} C_a(A,δ), with no normalization. If δ₁≤δ₂, the δ₁-cover class is contained in the δ₂-cover class, so C_a(A,δ₁)≥C_a(A,δ₂); hence the decreasing-scale limit is this supremum. M001 yields C_s(E,δ)→∞ as δ↓0. For an arbitrary Nat-indexed δ-cover Vᵢ of F, put ρᵢ=ediam(Vᵢ), Aᵢ=π₁(Vᵢ), Bᵢ=π₂(Vᵢ). Projection is 1-Lipschitz, so both projected diameters are ≤ρᵢ. Choose ηᵢ=ε2^(−i−1)/(1+ρᵢ^s); since Bᵢ is bounded, enclose it in an open interval Jᵢ of length at most ρᵢ+ηᵢ by extending its infimum/supremum enclosure by total width ηᵢ. For each t∈[0,1] and x∈E, choose i with (x,t)∈Vᵢ; then x∈Aᵢ and t∈Bᵢ⊆Jᵢ. Thus the Aᵢ for which t∈Jᵢ cover E, and C_s(E,δ)≤∑'ᵢ 1_{Jᵢ∩[0,1]}(t)ρᵢ^s pointwise. Let ν=volume.restrict([0,1]). The set Jᵢ∩[0,1] is Borel, so its indicator times ρᵢ^s is measurable and AEMeasurable for ν. Also ν([0,1])=volume([0,1])=ofReal(1−0)=1 by M011, so ν is finite. Integrate the inequality using M009, then use M002; countability is ℕ and each summand is AEMeasurable. By M010 the i-th integral equals ρᵢ^sν(Jᵢ∩[0,1]). The restriction definition gives ν(S)=volume(S∩[0,1])≤volume(S) for measurable S. Enclose Jᵢ∩[0,1] in [aᵢ,bᵢ] with bᵢ−aᵢ≤ρᵢ+ηᵢ. Measure monotonicity (M013) gives volume(Jᵢ∩[0,1])≤volume([aᵢ,bᵢ]), and M011 evaluates the latter as ofReal(bᵢ−aᵢ)≤ofReal(ρᵢ+ηᵢ). Consequently C_s(E,δ)≤∑'ᵢρᵢ^(s+1)+∑'ᵢηᵢρᵢ^s≤∑'ᵢρᵢ^(s+1)+ε, since ∑ᵢ2^(−i−1)≤1. The cover is fixed and ε arbitrary; if its (s+1)-cost is finite, taking ε↓0 gives C_s(E,δ)≤that cost, while for infinite cost the inequality is immediate. Taking the infimum over all δ-covers yields C_s(E,δ)≤C_(s+1)(F,δ). The left tends to infinity as δ↓0, so the right does too; M008 then gives H^(s+1)(F)=∞. M001 at the NNReal coercion of s+1 gives s+1≤dim_H(F). As this holds for every 0<s<D, density yields D+1≤dim_H(F).\"}]}}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_artifact","description":"Check a JSON artifact against the explicit stage contract; this is not automatic mathematical certification.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_artifact","description":"Submit a JSON artifact after its stage checks.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"report_obstacle","description":"Report exact status, location, explanation, basis, partial_progress. SUBSTANTIVE_GAP or SUSPECTED_GAP stops for an actual unsupported mathematical implication; give its premises, conclusion and mathematical grounds. SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE or INPUT_CONFLICT stops for a real source-access/original-input obstacle. Ordinary unfinished drafting, source registration or format work must use TASK_INCOMPLETE: this records progress without ending the stage; continue the actual work. Difficulty or artifact incompletion alone is not a mathematical gap.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"obstacle_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["obstacle_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_draft","description":"Preferred structured-object form of check_artifact: provide artifact as an actual JSON object, not an escaped JSON string. Same complete validation and acceptance scope.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}},"required":["artifact"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_draft","description":"Preferred structured-object form of submit_artifact: provide artifact as an actual JSON object, not an escaped JSON string. Same complete validation and acceptance scope.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}},"required":["artifact"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"probe_library","description":"Query a proved Mathlib theorem and its exact signature/axioms in the offline sandbox. Returns located evidence for an M source; the mathematical statement and applicability still require review.","parameters"